[
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:0.1"], "en": "The *Therāpadāna*:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:0.2"], "en": "The Section on Kaccāyana (Kaccāyanavagga) 1.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:0.3"], "en": "The *Apadāna* of the Elder Mahākaccāyana.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:1.1"], "en": "“The Victor named Padumuttara,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:1.2"], "en": "the unshaken one, the unconquered conqueror,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:1.3"], "en": "[appeared] after a hundred thousand aeons.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:1.4"], "en": "From here the Leader arose—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:2.1", "PA_tha-ap_533:2.2"], "en": "the Hero with eyes like lotus petals and a face as stainless as the moon.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:2.3"], "en": "Resembling a mountain of gold,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:2.4"], "en": "with a radiance equal to the splendor of the sun,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:3.1"], "en": "he captivates the eyes and minds of living beings.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:3.2"], "en": "Adorned with the marks of excellence,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:3.3"], "en": "he transcends all paths of speech,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:3.4"], "en": "and is honored by humans and gods alike.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:4.1"], "en": "The Perfectly Awakened One,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:4.2"], "en": "the Lord of Speech with his sweet voice,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:4.3"], "en": "brings beings to awakening, his continuum bound by compassion.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:4.4"], "en": "Confident among assemblies,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:5.1"], "en": "he teaches the sweet Dhamma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:5.2"], "en": "which is connected with the Four Noble Truths.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:5.3", "PA_tha-ap_533:5.4"], "en": "When he has rescued living beings from the mire of delusion,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:6.1"], "en": "he then becomes a solitary wanderer.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:6.2"], "en": "A forest-dwelling ascetic from the Himalayas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:6.3", "PA_tha-ap_533:6.4"], "en": "traveling through the air toward the human world, saw the Conqueror.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:7.1"], "en": "Approaching his presence with equanimity,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:7.2", "PA_tha-ap_533:7.3"], "en": "I heard the teaching of the Dhamma from that Hero as he was expounding it.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:7.4"], "en": "The great virtue of a disciple.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:8.1"], "en": "\"What has been stated by me in brief,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:8.2"], "en": "explain it in detail.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:8.3"], "en": "And he delights the assembly,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:8.4"], "en": "just as this Kaccāyana does;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:9.1"], "en": "I do not delight anyone here in such a manner.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:9.2"], "en": "I see no other disciple;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:9.3", "PA_tha-ap_533:9.4"], "en": "therefore, O monks, you should remember him as the foremost in this regard.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:10.1", "PA_tha-ap_533:10.2"], "en": "Then, filled with wonder upon hearing those delightful words,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:10.3"], "en": "I went to the Himalayas.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:10.4", "PA_tha-ap_533:11.1"], "en": "Having set aside my collection of flowers and having worshipped the Refuge of the World,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:11.2"], "en": "I aspired for that state.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:11.3"], "en": "Then, knowing my intention,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:11.4"], "en": "that renunciant declared:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:12.1"], "en": "\"Behold this best of seers!\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:12.2"], "en": "With skin like polished gold,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:12.3"], "en": "with hair standing erect, broad-shouldered,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:12.4"], "en": "he stood motionless with palms joined in reverence.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:13.1"], "en": "With a smile and eyes full of joy,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:13.2"], "en": "his heart intent upon the praise of the Buddha,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:13.3"], "en": "with a mind born of the Dhamma and a heart full of resolve—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:13.4"], "en": "\"Resembling one drenched in the nectar of immortality.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:14.1"], "en": "Having heard of Kaccāna’s virtues,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:14.2"], "en": "he stood longing for that state.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:14.3"], "en": "In a future time,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:14.4", "PA_tha-ap_533:15.1"], "en": "he will be the heir to the teachings of Gotama, the Great Sage.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:15.2"], "en": "Born from the heart, fashioned by the Dhamma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:15.3", "PA_tha-ap_533:15.4"], "en": "he will be a disciple of the Teacher known by the name Kaccāna.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:16.1"], "en": "One who is learned, possessed of great wisdom,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:16.2"], "en": "and understands the intention of the Sage,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:16.3"], "en": "shall reach that state.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:16.4"], "en": "Just as this has been explained by me:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:17.1"], "en": "\"In a hundred thousand aeons past,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:17.2"], "en": "such was the deed that I performed then.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:17.3"], "en": "I do not know a state of woe;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:17.4"], "en": "this is the fruit of worshipping the Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:18.1"], "en": "I have wandered through two existences.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:18.2", "PA_tha-ap_533:18.3"], "en": "Neither in the state of a god nor in the human realm do I go to any other destination;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:18.4"], "en": "this is the fruit of my worship of the Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:19.1"], "en": "I am born into two kinds of families:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:19.2"], "en": "among kshatriyas or among brahmins;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:19.3"], "en": "I am not born into a low family.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:19.4"], "en": "This is the fruit of worshipping the Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:20.1"], "en": "And now, in my final existence,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:20.2"], "en": "I have been born in the city of Ujjayinī.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:20.3", "PA_tha-ap_533:20.4", "PA_tha-ap_533:21.1"], "en": "The son of Tiriṭivaccha, [born] of the fierce Pajjota, the lord of brahmins who were his household priests.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:21.2"], "en": "I was a skilled master of the Vedas;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:21.3"], "en": "my mother’s name was Candimā,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:21.4"], "en": "and I was Kaccāna, possessed of excellent skin.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:22.1", "PA_tha-ap_533:22.2"], "en": "Sent by the protector of the earth to investigate the Buddha,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:22.3"], "en": "he beheld the gateway to the city of liberation.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:22.4", "PA_tha-ap_533:23.1", "PA_tha-ap_533:23.2"], "en": "Having heard the Leader’s stainless speech, which dries up the mire of rebirth, [one hears] the accumulation of virtues.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:23.3"], "en": "I attained the peaceful deathless,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:23.4"], "en": "together with the remaining seven;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:24.1"], "en": "I became one who understands the underlying intention.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:24.2", "PA_tha-ap_533:24.3"], "en": "O Mahāmati, he was established by the Sugata as foremost in this regard,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:24.4"], "en": "his heart’s desire being perfectly fulfilled.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:25.1"], "en": "The defilements have been burnt away by me;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:25.2"], "en": "all states of existence have been uprooted;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:25.3"], "en": "like a nāga who has severed his bonds, I am free.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:25.4"], "en": "I dwell free from taints.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:26.1", "PA_tha-ap_533:26.2"], "en": "Welcome indeed has come to me in the presence of the Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:26.3"], "en": "The three true insights have been attained;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:26.4"], "en": "the Buddha’s teaching has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:27.1"], "en": "The four analytical knowledges—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:27.2", "PA_tha-ap_533:27.3"], "en": "And these eight liberations have been realized; the six direct knowledges have been attained;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:27.4"], "en": "the Buddha’s teaching has been accomplished.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:28.1"], "en": "Thus indeed did the venerable elder Mahākaccāyana speak these verses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_533:29.1"], "en": "This is the first *apadāna* of the elder Mahākaccāyana.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:24:12Z"}
]
